              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "Dear {!$Expression.First_Name} {!$Expression.Last_Name},<br /><br />We hope you are as excited as we are to be part of our Zeta community. <br />Zeta Charter Schools began in 2018 with a dream for what education could make possible for children across New York City. At its heart was a simple idea: when you build a school around love for children, you build differently.<br /><br />What does it mean to build a school around love?<br /><br />We often say Zeta is a love story. And we mean it. Every child in our schools is deeply known, their dreams are nurtured and they are empowered to become who they are capable of becoming.<br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "bbf0ea99-526d-48e3-960b-d6dbbefe7dd2",
